{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\eng\\144.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Listening", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[154, 192], [300, 199], [298, 235], [152, 228]]}, {"text": "Computers and the Internet", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[415, 234], [931, 226], [931, 265], [416, 273]]}, {"text": "The given icons represent different functions within a computer. In pairs, match the", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[98, 342], [1146, 323], [1147, 356], [99, 374]]}, {"text": "wordstothecorrecticons.", "conf": 0.946, "box": [[100, 381], [426, 376], [426, 403], [101, 408]]}, {"text": "help", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[1029, 453], [1093, 455], [1092, 489], [1028, 486]]}, {"text": "copy", "conf": 0.782, "box": [[206, 470], [268, 470], [268, 502], [206, 502]]}, {"text": "search", "conf": 0.793, "box": [[1015, 600], [1104, 595], [1105, 626], [1017, 631]]}, {"text": "cut", "conf": 0.748, "box": [[205, 616], [249, 613], [251, 640], [207, 643]]}, {"text": "print", "conf": 0.797, "box": [[1025, 735], [1093, 731], [1096, 764], [1027, 768]]}, {"text": "edit", "conf": 0.762, "box": [[203, 754], [256, 751], [258, 782], [205, 785]]}, {"text": "paste", "conf": 0.815, "box": [[1020, 877], [1096, 870], [1099, 901], [1022, 908]]}, {"text": "folder", "conf": 0.82, "box": [[203, 895], [280, 895], [280, 926], [203, 926]]}, {"text": "Listen to the short clip about computers and complete the activities.", "conf": 0.943, "box": [[99, 983], [938, 963], [939, 995], [100, 1015]]}, {"text": "Computers", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[116, 1040], [253, 1040], [253, 1070], [116, 1070]]}, {"text": "It's hard to believe that no one had computers a few years ago. Iwonder how people lived.There", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[107, 1095], [1142, 1072], [1143, 1102], [108, 1125]]}, {"text": "must have been a lot of paperwork. I can't imagine writing everything by hand. We need", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[107, 1137], [1142, 1113], [1143, 1143], [108, 1167]]}, {"text": "computers today for everything: Hospitals, airports, the police... nothing can work without", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[106, 1177], [1143, 1151], [1144, 1184], [107, 1210]]}, {"text": "computers. I'm sure I'd be ten times busier than now if I didn't have a computer. Imagine having", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[105, 1216], [1140, 1195], [1141, 1228], [106, 1249]]}, {"text": "to find a piece of paper and an envelope and then walking down the street to mail a letter! Ilove", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[104, 1257], [1140, 1235], [1141, 1268], [105, 1290]]}, {"text": "my computer. It makes everything in my life so convenient. Sure, it freezes and crashes", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[105, 1299], [1139, 1276], [1140, 1309], [106, 1332]]}, {"text": "sometimes. Sure l lose some data. But that's not often. Most of the time my computer is like my", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[102, 1338], [1137, 1320], [1138, 1353], [103, 1371]]}, {"text": "bestfriend.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[105, 1381], [224, 1381], [224, 1408], [105, 1408]]}, {"text": "Teacher's note: In the absence of the audio file, read the text to the class.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[94, 1541], [784, 1528], [784, 1555], [95, 1568]]}, {"text": "UNOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.703, "box": [[298, 1606], [490, 1599], [491, 1626], [299, 1633]]}, {"text": "137", "conf": 0.746, "box": [[582, 1598], [623, 1598], [623, 1630], [582, 1630]]}]}